--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ffd20afc55e26974198aa9b1c0c0eedf, type: 3}
  m_Name: Scene3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LevelSubtitleDialogueObject
  AudioClip:
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: Ringnig
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 795f427c74947774bac40e00da08df91, type: 3}
      volume: 0.86
      pitch: 1.566
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: (Ringing)
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 1
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0aed8079ff1904344a594a13477b4ecc, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: "Well I have to say I\u2019m impressed, not many juniors get this
      far."
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 2
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3ea4757d5a9c37a4180820441f661860, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: So I have something to tell you, with the great work you have been
      doing so far. You have earned this week's free parking spot. This means that
      the coveted parking spot in our headquarters will be booked just for you when
      you arrive from work. Congratulations.
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 3
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b421cbaddd6990e4ab6a7a506c804ed1, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: "You can only use it once but it\u2019s still a great prize. Well
      done. This promotion and prize you also earned more delivery that requires
      the utmost precision in our coveted start systems."
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 4
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e0a07885b8bf75f4b9d0130b07c0604d, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: So now this system that you are in is the Fomalhaut system, this
      system which was first settled in the year 2598 is a system that isn't on our
      delivery route often but when it is, requires the best of the best to deliver
      our products.
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 4
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8cf4dd1f7b79f604586e939dffe197c1, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: Since you have been doing so well, I feel you are the most suitable
      candidate, Yay!!!. So get out, deliver and prove why you deserved to steal
      my favorite parking spot, get going chump!
